{"knowledgePointId":"g6-data-probability-reasoning","passThreshold":0.8,"questions":[{"id":"q1","type":"choice","prompt":"袋中有3个红球、1个蓝球，随机取1个，取到红球的可能性是？","options":["25%","50%","75%","100%"],"correctAnswer":"75%","explanation":"有利结果3个，全部4个，3÷4=75%。","points":10},{"id":"q2","type":"fill-blank","prompt":"转盘平均分成5份，其中2份为绿色，指针停在绿色的可能性是____。","correctAnswer":"40%","explanation":"2÷5=40%。","points":10},{"id":"q3","type":"choice","prompt":"扇形图中某类占圆的四分之一，对应百分数是？","options":["10%","20%","25%","40%"],"correctAnswer":"25%","explanation":"四分之一等于25%。","points":10},{"id":"q4","type":"choice","prompt":"掷一枚公平骰子，掷出偶数的可能性是？","options":["1/6","1/3","1/2","2/3"],"correctAnswer":"1/2","explanation":"偶数2、4、6共3种，全部6种，3÷6=1/2。","points":10},{"id":"q5","type":"choice","prompt":"用数字1、2各选一个组成两位数，不重复选，可能组成几个数？","options":["1个","2个","3个","4个"],"correctAnswer":"2个","explanation":"只有12和21两种。","points":10},{"id":"q6","type":"true-false","prompt":"条形图中柱子更高，就一定表示百分比更大。","correctAnswer":"错","explanation":"还要确认各组总量和纵轴单位；总量不同不能只比柱高。","points":10}],"reviewSets":{"d1":{"questions":[{"id":"d1q1","type":"choice","prompt":"袋中2白3黑，取到白球可能性是？","options":["20%","40%","60%"],"correctAnswer":"40%","explanation":"2÷5=40%。","points":10},{"id":"d1q2","type":"fill-blank","prompt":"圆的三分之一对应____%。","correctAnswer":"约33.3","explanation":"1÷3约等于33.3%。","points":10}]},"d7":{"questions":[{"id":"d7q1","type":"choice","prompt":"公平硬币正面可能性是？","options":["1/4","1/2","3/4"],"correctAnswer":"1/2","explanation":"正反两种等可能结果，正面占一半。","points":10},{"id":"d7q2","type":"fill-blank","prompt":"红球4个、蓝球6个，取到红球的可能性是____%。","correctAnswer":"40%","explanation":"4÷10=40%。","points":10}]}}}
